<title>POLAND: ROLIMPEX UP IN WARSAW CONTINUOUS TRADE.</title>
<headline>ROLIMPEX UP IN WARSAW CONTINUOUS TRADE.</headline>
<text>
<p>1000 GMT - Shares in Rolimpex were quoted at 108.5 zlotys</p>
<p>in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday, 2.6 percent higher</p>
<p>than at Friday's main market's fixing.</p>
<p>Mass privatisation units were trading at 108</p>
<p>zlotys, 2.9 percent higher than Friday's fixing.</p>
<p>By 1000 GMT BIG , BPH , Debica </p>
<p>and Elektrim did not trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
